<view class="page"><view class="panel"><view class="row"><view><view class="section-title">连接状态</view><view class="state">{{state}}</view></view><view class="tag">RSSI {{rssi}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{lastError}}" class="error">{{lastError}}</view></view><view class="panel"><view class="section-title">设备与 GATT</view><view class="grid"><text>名称</text><text>{{deviceName}}</text><text>Device ID</text><text class="wrap">{{deviceId}}</text><text>FFE0</text><text>{{service ? '已发现' : '未发现'}}</text><text>FFE1 Notify</text><text>{{notify ? '已发现' : '未发现'}}</text><text>FFE2 Write</text><text>{{write ? '已发现' : '未发现'}}</text><text>Firmware</text><text>{{firmware}}</text><text>Schema</text><text>{{schema}}</text><text>Map</text><text>{{map}}</text></view></view><view class="panel"><view class="section-title">接收统计</view><view class="grid"><text>通知 / 字节</text><text>{{diagnostics.rxNotifications}} / {{diagnostics.rxBytes}}</text><text>有效帧</text><text>{{diagnostics.frames}}</text><text>FAST / SLOW / CHECK</text><text>{{diagnostics.fastFrames}} / {{diagnostics.slowFrames}} / {{diagnostics.checkweighFrames}}</text><text>Gap / Duplicate</text><text>{{diagnostics.sequenceGaps}} / {{diagnostics.duplicates}}</text><text>CRC / Resync</text><text>{{diagnostics.crcErrors}} / {{diagnostics.resyncBytes}}</text><text>命令成功 / 超时 / 错配</text><text>{{diagnostics.commandSuccess}} / {{diagnostics.commandTimeouts}} / {{diagnostics.commandMismatches}}</text><text>设备信息成功 / 超时</text><text>{{diagnostics.deviceInfoSuccess}} / {{diagnostics.deviceInfoTimeout}}</text><text>活动配置成功 / 超时</text><text>{{diagnostics.activeConfigSuccess}} / {{diagnostics.activeConfigTimeout}}</text><text>异常断连 / 重连</text><text>{{diagnostics.unexpectedDisconnects}} / {{diagnostics.reconnectAttempts}}</text><text>最大陈旧时间</text><text>{{diagnostics.maxStaleMs}} ms</text><text>首次发现 / 连接</text><text>{{diagnostics.firstDeviceFoundMs || '-'}} / {{diagnostics.connectMs || '-'}} ms</text><text>订阅 / 首帧</text><text>{{diagnostics.subscribeMs || '-'}} / {{diagnostics.firstFrameMs || '-'}} ms</text><text>最近有效帧年龄</text><text>{{lastAge}}</text></view></view><view class="button-row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="copy">复制摘要</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="clear">开始/清空统计</button></view><button class="danger" bindtap="disconnect" disabled="{{state === 'CLOSED'}}">主动断开</button></view>
